# Enterprise Search Autocomplete (FROZEN)

## Pattern

Type → Select → Dropdown closes → Value populated → Continue working

Never leave the results list open after selection. Never require manual dismissal.

## Display

- Show results only after the user types
- Filtered matches only (max 8)
- Compact height (`max-h-40`) with internal scroll
- Absolute overlay — do not push / dominate the form

## SSOT

- Constants: `src/constants/enterprise-search-autocomplete.ts`
- Primatives: `EntityMasterSearch`, `LiveEntityMasterSearch`, `EnterpriseLenderSearch`, `CitySelect`, `EcmMasterSelect`

Applies to Contact, Company, Lender, Partner, Opportunity, Deal, and Product registry lookups.

## Constitutional rule — No UI control without SSOT

No search field, dropdown, lookup, autocomplete, or selector may ship unless connected to its Enterprise Registry:

| Entity | Registry |
|--------|----------|
| Customer / Contact / Builder / CA / Lawyer / Valuer | Enterprise Contact Registry |
| Company | Enterprise Company Registry |
| Lender | Enterprise Lender Registry |
| Branch | Enterprise Branch / Lender coverage |
| City | Enterprise City Master |
| Product | Enterprise Product Master |
| Employee | Enterprise Employee / User Registry |
| Wealth Partner | Enterprise Wealth Partner Registry |
| Vendor | Enterprise Vendor Registry |

Empty UI controls are incomplete. Prefer live registry APIs (`liveSearchOperationalContacts`, `searchActiveLenders`, `searchAssignableUsers`, Product Master options). Never present seed/demo catalogs as production entity truth.
